          "id": "room_or_desk_comment_001_01",
          "speaker": "alterra",
          "text": "机が荒れてるんだね。全部片づけようとすると、たぶん負ける。",
          "displayText": "Your desk is messy. If you try to clean all of it, you will probably lose.",
